m Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T10:39:20-07:00","id":1391993,"title":"","content":"Maybe just come inside and have a nice cup of tea. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T13:57:39-07:00","id":1392040,"title":"","content":"Malkavians have had fans for a while. I've heard a lot more bad stories about them than good stories, but that is true of most character groups. If you have a clan whose weakness is mental illness like the Malkavians or they have to try and trick everyone like the Ravnos, then the annoying players picking up those clans are more likely to be annoying, in my experience.<br /> <br /> So, I don't mind the Union dropping spirit nukes to get rid of Ravnos. I'm not a fan of vampires and that clan was problematic from the get-go. Though a Malkavian did feed my Brujah environmental vigilante blood tainted with a bunch of Nephandi worms in a combined Mage/Vampire game. That was the best campaign I ever played in, so the Malkavians get a little leeway. Thankfully, the dice were low because unloading with a submachine into the room where your Egyptian mage friend of the Orphan faction is standing is not good for your health. . .I completely missed the mage. So, in Angel where Harmony is set up with human blood from the fridge, I totally get that. . .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T19:04:08-07:00","id":1392097,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar352_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"352\" data-vbnamecard=\"352\">Black Flag</a> wtf? So for real I wasted $20 on a book that hasn\u2019t even been \u201ccanon\u201d since before the millennium...<br /> <br /> Damn. My ex told me nobody liked those guys. I really need to read the fine print on this stuff \ud83d\ude02.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T19:44:57-07:00","id":1392108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1388887-my-thoughts-about-technocracy-reloaded?p=1392097#post1392097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> wtf? So for real I wasted $20 on a book that hasn\u2019t even been \u201ccanon\u201d since before the millennium...<br /> <br /> Damn. My ex told me nobody liked those guys. I really need to read the fine print on this stuff \ud83d\ude02.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is a darn shame. While there were several parts of V20 Black Hand I didn't like, it did nail the sect's tone and atmosphere, particularly the part about the Aralu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23964-el-barto","name":"El Barto","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-27T21:35:33-07:00","id":1392117,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1388887-my-thoughts-about-technocracy-reloaded?p=1392097#post1392097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar352_3.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"352\" data-vbnamecard=\"352\">Black Flag</a> wtf? So for real I wasted $20 on a book that hasn\u2019t even been \u201ccanon\u201d since before the millennium...<br /> <br /> Damn. My ex told me nobody liked those guys. I really need to read the fine print on this stuff \ud83d\ude02.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, their V20 book seems to be an effort to bring them back, not as a conspiracy within the Sabbat (that got outed and purged) but as a minor sect that the major sects know about but don\u2019t really understand, like an evil Inconnu. They show up in that capacity in Beckett\u2019s Jyhad Diary. <br /> <br /> So in other words, yes, V3 did write them out of the setting, but V20 seems to have written them back in, only in a less dumb way. (The original Dirty Secrets of the Black Hand book was gloriously dumb.)<br /> <br /> So if you like them, it\u2019s not wasted. I wouldn\u2019t expect to see them in V5 for a very long time, though. The major sects have to come before the super obscure ones, and they\u2019re not going to let the Tal\u2019mahe\u2019ra steal the Sabbat\u2019s thunder again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-28T08:34:55-07:00","id":1392202,"title":"","content":"Thank you guys. Now I feel a little better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]}]}